  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-biomarker-ranges",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：生物年龄计算服务\n\n基于Morgan Levine PhenoAge时钟模型，通过血液生物标志物计算生物年龄的服务。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **calculate_phenoage** — Calculate biological age using the Morgan Levine PhenoAge clock based on blood biomarkers\n- **get_biomarker_ranges** — Get reference ranges and optimal values for PhenoAge biomarkers"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-biomarker-ranges\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-biomarker-ranges\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
